{"sections":{"banner":{"type":"banner-image","settings":{}},"917bbf2b-cba3-4666-8e43-0a2ed853a808":{"type":"accordion","blocks":{"panel_fCBC7m":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"How do I clean my panels?","content":"<p>We recommend professional dry cleaning.<\/p>"}},"panel_8ktqyy":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"Do the panels come with the hooks\/pins installed?","content":"<p>Yes, hooks\/pins are pre installed 1.5\" down from the top.<\/p>"}},"panel_at3VeB":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"HOW DO I DETERMINE WHAT PANEL LENGTH I NEED?","content":""}},"panel_cEzJnK":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"Are panels sold as a pair?","content":"<p>No, our drapery panels are sold individually. We typically suggest two panels for one window.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},"panel_dEAEtX":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"HOW DO I DETERMINE WHAT PANEL WIDTH I NEED?","content":"<p>While we do not assist with sizing recommendations. For most standard windows we suggest a pair of 1.5 width panels<\/p>"}},"template--14485296676944__917bbf2b-cba3-4666-8e43-0a2ed853a808-168020443963831405-0":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"CAN I SEND THESE BACK TO BE MADE SHORTER?","content":"<p>No. Unfortunately after the pleating process has been completed we can not alter the length and or width whatsoever<\/p>"}},"template--14485296676944__917bbf2b-cba3-4666-8e43-0a2ed853a808-168020443963831405-1":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"DO YOU SELL HARDWARE?","content":"<p>Not at this time.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},"template--14485296676944__917bbf2b-cba3-4666-8e43-0a2ed853a808-168020443963831405-2":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"CAN YOU DO A CUSTOM LENGTH?","content":"<p>Yes, if you are needing a custom length, please email for a quote.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},"panel_xQyCd8":{"type":"panel","settings":{"heading":"CAN DRAPES BE MADE IN ANY LITTLE DESIGN CO FABRIC?","content":"<p>Yes, we can make our drapes in a variety of our fabrics, please email custom@shoplittldesignco.com with details and